OL,3,AUS markets to open as tech giant Nvidia
OL,4,Ainvestigates CEO's affair with
OL,5,Asuspected Chinese spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrading on Wall Street is set to open
OL,8,Fat 14:30 GMT, with all eyes on US tech
OL,9,Fgiant Nvidia - one of the most valuable
OL,10,Ffirms in the world - after claims its
OL,11,FCEO Jensen Huang had an affair with a
OL,12,FChinese spy
OL,14,FPre-market trading suggests the firm
OL,15,Fwill suffer a sharp fall in its share
OL,16,Fprice
OL,18,FOn Sunday, Nvidia opened an independent
OL,19,Finvestigation into claims Huang "had
OL,20,Fbeen the target of a foreign
OL,21,Fintelligence effort"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
